	"thatwasdulbmeethushewasagodfromthestarthedidnotclimbtoitearnitorwinitinabethewassimplytherefirstandbeingtherefirsthedecidedthingshedecidedthereshouldbegroundsopeoplewouldhavesomewheretosithedecidedthereshouldbepeoplesosomebodycouldhearhimhedecidedthegoblinsshouldhavejobsthatonedidnotworkout": "narrator/narrator_clone_that_was_dulbmeethus_he_was_a_god_from_the_start.ogg",  # That was Dulbmeethus. He was a god from the start. He did not climb to it, earn it or win it in a bet. He was simply there first, and being there first, he decided things.  He decided there should be ground, so people would have somewhere to sit. He decided there should be people, so somebody could hear him. He decided the goblins should have jobs. That one did not work out.
